              <b>TIME AND DATE</b></span></td>
          <td style="width: 44%; padding-right: 5.4pt; padding-bottom: 12pt; padding-left: 5.4pt; text-align: center; font: 10pt Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; font-size: 10pt; color: Red"><img alt="" src="ny20067611x1_image03.jpg"/></span><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; font-size: 10pt"><br/>
              <b>PLACE</b></span></td>
          <td style="width: 28%; padding-right: 5.4pt; padding-bottom: 12pt; padding-left: 5.4pt; text-align: center; font: 10pt Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; font-size: 10pt; color: Red"><img alt="" src="ny20067611x1_image04.jpg"/></span><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; font-size: 10pt"><br/>
              <b>RECORD DATE</b></span></td>
        </tr>
        <tr style="vertical-align: top; font: 10pt Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif">
          <td style="padding-right: 5.4pt; font: 10pt Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; padding-left: 5.4pt; text-align: center"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; font-size: 10pt">9:30 a.m. Eastern Time <br/>
              on Thursday, May 28, 2026</span></td>
          <td style="padding-right: 5.4pt; font: 10pt Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; padding-left: 5.4pt; text-align: center">
            <p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; font-size: 10pt">The Annual Meeting will be hosted <br/>
                via live audio webcast on the Internet at</span></p>
            <p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0"><span style="font: 10pt Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif">www.virtualshareholdermeeting.com/AFCG2026.</span></p>
          </td>
          <td style="padding-right: 5.4pt; font: 10pt Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; padding-left: 5.4pt; text-align: center"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; font-size: 10pt">March 30, 2026</span></td>
        </tr>

    </table>
    <p style="font: bold 10pt Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0; text-align: center">&#160;</p>
    <p style="font: bold 10pt Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: center"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif;">Voting</span></p>
    <p style="font: bold 10pt Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0; text-align: center"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif;">&#160;</span></p>
    <p style="font: 10pt Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0;"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif;">Shareholders as of the close of business on the record date are entitled to vote. If you
        are a beneficial owner who owns shares of our common stock, par value $0.01 per share (&#8220;Common Stock&#8221;), registered in the name of a broker, bank or other nominee, please follow the instructions they provide on how to vote your shares. Shareholders
        of record may vote as follows:</span></p>
    <p style="font: 10pt Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0;"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif;">&#160;</span></p>
