    <p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0;">&#160;</p>
    <p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0;"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif;">The following table sets forth the dollar range of the Company&#8217;s equity securities beneficially owned by the director nominees
        and each of its other directors as of March 30, 2026. The Company is not part of a &#8220;family of investment companies,&#8221; as the term is defined in the 1940 Act.</span></p>
